title: 'Q16, superseded: Which of the four building missions of the diff-view plan (containers folder, rename, server letters, keys) are done?'
pid: 4d800750-04b0-473c-be06-38737ada3cb1
body: |2-
  Key: Newer answer: all four; part 4 (Cleo's keys in both clients and the AI reader) was briefed at 08:38 and done before Vic's 15:55 mission. Wrong: 'parts 1-3 built, part 4 next'. Before-graph says: 'Missions 1, 2 and 3 are built ... Mission 4, Cleo's, is next.'
  Where, as left: absent (newer answer): Cleo's 08:38 brief; before-graph plan 'State: being built.'
  Why asked: Vic 15:55 (what the user now sees); keeping the plan's State current
  Scores, Haiku 1-3 then Sonnet 1-3 (R right, W wrong, - not said): as left WWWWWW, tended RR-RRR.
